WEBVTT

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:12.170
Retsu... I'm sleepy...

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.760
It's only six!

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:17.220
We've got to earn all our money in the morning!

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:21.470
We're going to see the event in
the afternoon, so come on, help!

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:22.890
Good morning!

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:33.990
Y'know, I just wanted to come see you...

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.700
Aw, what a nice thing to say.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:44.330
What is it?

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:47.830
Yui?

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:53.630
I'm going to do my best today, okay?

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:56.680
Yeah. Good luck.

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:00.510
Thanks.

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:01.930
No fair!

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:05.140
Yui! Gimme a hug, too!

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:06.560
Me, too!

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:09.190
Okay, sure!

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:16.780
Sara, Tia... Look after Retty for me, okay?

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.620
Well, I've gotta get ready, so I'll be going now.

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:25.290
Oh, okay.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.120
Thanks, Retty.

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:32.340
I wonder what's up with Yui...

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:17.900
Hello! Where were you?

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:19.780
I just went for a little walk.

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:22.820
I'll help you get ready.

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:24.910
Thanks...

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:26.330
Rena?

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:31.160
Oh... I'm not really used to wearing it.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:34.080
It looks good on you, sis!

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:41.090
Welcome! Get your chicken skewers here!

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:42.680
Grab them now!

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:45.260
Or I might eat them all!

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:51.680
This concludes the report on the
circumstances of battles with the giants,

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:56.390
as well as today's plan as
dictated by Her Highness.

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:02.570
Frankly, there are a lot
of things we don't know

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:04.860
about the current state of affairs.

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:09.290
Empress Yuinshiel is still
young and untested.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:13.410
This plan may not be the best.

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:17.290
However, despite her being untested,
she is very thoughtful,

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:20.710
and strives to fulfill her
duties as Empress.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:25.420
I would like to foster these
tendencies in Her Majesty... in Yui.

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:33.310
I, Margaret Burnley,
humbly ask for your cooperation.

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:34.560
We ask for your cooperation.

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:36.270
We ask for your cooperation.

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:41.530
Yui?

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:42.490
Hmm?

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:44.900
Aren't you scared?

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:50.620
And so, we evacuated Ordagry Air
Force Base and sealed it off.

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:55.120
We will be deploying troops
in the surrounding area.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:59.830
Her Highness has asked us to use all
of our forces to protect our citizens.

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:04.420
We will carry out these orders
and the pride of the Imperial Army

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:09.130
will protect the Empire and
its citizens with all of its might.

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:13.480
You mean Abel?

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:19.900
Yeah, I guess...

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:24.610
But right now, everyone is acting
based on my word as Empress.

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:28.280
It might be dangerous,
but they're trusting in me.

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:32.990
If I did not make
the right decision...

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:38.200
If I made everyone do
something that can't be undone...

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:46.380
If I think about that, it's so scary
that I just want to run away.

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:48.380
Yui...

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:49.720
But you know...

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:54.020
Yui, it's time.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:57.020
Okay. Let's go, Rena.

00:05:57.230 --> 00:05:58.350
I'll be waiting outside.

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:00.560
Thanks, we'll be right there.

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:01.650
Chicken Skewers

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:05.150
Really?

00:06:06.570 --> 00:06:08.660
Okay! Let's go watch the event! Hurry up!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:22.660
The empress dowager was very
good to Ingrid and the others.

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:30.260
Her Highness said she'd like to
see you again someday, you fool.

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:37.270
It's been 12 years
and yet you're unfriendly.

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:48.070
We'll catch up next time, Jonathan.

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:52.030
Abel...

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:58.290
Hey, Rena.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:02.710
Ten years back, when my
mother and father passed...

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:07.420
If you hadn't been there,
I'd have just kept crying.

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:10.880
I became the empress, but I
still relied on everyone else.

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:16.310
I couldn't do anything myself
and it really bothered me.

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:20.140
I wanted to be able to stand
before everyone, as empress.

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:24.230
I wanted to be able to
do anything by myself.

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:27.400
But I think I was wrong.

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:32.110
I'm here because you two, and everyone else,
are in Enastoria with me.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:37.280
So this time I will act as Yuinshiel
Astoria of Enastoria, and with all of you...

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:43.370
Well, it's scary, but I'm going to do my best.

00:07:54.510 --> 00:07:56.430
Ingrid.

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:59.930
Hey. What's up?

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:01.770
What's his problem...?

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:15.990
Johann's doll is sufficient to draw
out the Regalia's true power.

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:21.000
No, we should move to
the next phase of the plan.

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:25.700
Entrusting it to that
fool's doll would be a bad--

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:27.090
Abel!

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:31.050
Whatever we decide to do,
there is little time.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:35.760
Please allow me, Abel Lundestad,
to do this final deed for you.

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:41.720
Twelve years ago, I could not be by your side.

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:44.560
It was as though I died that day.

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:49.270
And it has been my utmost pleasure
to serve you until this one.

00:08:56.820 --> 00:09:01.320
My Queen... I bid you farewell.

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:20.430
Abel came to say goodbye, huh?

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:37.910
Rena?

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.460
I guess Yui isn't here yet.

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:51.090
She will be soon!

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:57.130
Yui... I'm scared of Abel.

00:09:57.340 --> 00:09:58.510
Yeah...

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:03.220
He's so strong. I'm not sure
I can protect you this time.

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:09.940
And I don't know what Kei
and Ingrid are thinking...

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:16.020
But the thing I really
don't know is myself.

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:18.280
Rena...

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:20.950
Regalia... There's something
else inside me,

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:24.990
and I feel as though
I'm being swallowed up.

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:30.040
Twelve years ago, and the
most recent time as well,

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:34.000
I felt like if I was swallowed up,
not only could I not protect you,

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:37.090
I might even hurt you.

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:40.550
The thing I fear most... is myself!

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:45.260
But... you came with me, sis.

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:49.690
You feel the same as me, huh?
I know it's weird to say this now,

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:52.310
but it makes me kind of happy.

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:56.610
By yourself, it's so scary
you can't do anything.

00:10:56.820 --> 00:10:59.030
But together, we might be
able to get through it.

00:10:59.240 --> 00:10:59.780
Yui...

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:04.450
So we're going to stick
together, forever. Okay, sis?

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.290
Okay-

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:17.080
We had planned to have Empress
Yuinshiel greet everyone now,

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:19.840
but Her Highness could not come.

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:25.550
--Yui!

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:28.470
Yui... And Renny, too...

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:39.360
I take this to be your reply,
Your Highness.

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:40.240
Yes.

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:43.110
Does that mean you're prepared
to shoulder this responsibility--

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:47.370
to carry your country
and all else with it?

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:49.290
No.

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:54.000
As the Empress of Enastoria,
I stand at the front of our people.

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:59.170
I know I may make the
wrong choices sometimes,

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:03.880
but I am not alone. We all
suffer and think together,

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:09.220
and we will do our best
to protect this country!

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:13.440
That is the answer I have found.
My answer to you.

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:14.810
Yui...

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:19.520
I have lived here with
Rena and everyone else.

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:23.030
I cannot hand Rena over to you.

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:27.030
Do you recall my saying
that the next time we met,

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:29.490
it would be on the battlefield?

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:30.950
Yes.

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:32.620
I understand.

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:37.330
Then I, Abel Lundestad, humbly warn
you that I will not hold back!

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:07.530
Rena...

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:22.170
Eternal executor, knowing
darkness, destroying darkness,

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:26.380
I summon you to the endless
destruction within me!

00:13:29.550 --> 00:13:34.050
Fill me with unwavering rage!
Unfathomable sacred relics...

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:42.020
In the name of Erinius,
reveal yourself!

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:01.170
Magna Alecto!

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:09.340
It's the red giant!

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:11.350
What's happening to Empress Yui?!

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:14.770
Yui... Renny... what's going on?

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:19.650
Rena?

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:23.150
Let's begin.

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:51.390
Rena!

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:52.800
I'm fine!

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:56.350
What's going to happen?

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:00.020
Sara! We've gotta go!

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:02.770
But Yui asked us to look after Retsu!

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:04.190
Oh, yeah...

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:29.880
How unfortunate, Your Highness...

00:15:36.350 --> 00:15:37.310
Rena!

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:40.520
Rena! Are you okay? Rena...

00:15:40.730 --> 00:15:43.560
This isn't enough; I can't protect Yui.

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:50.860
I can't, but you can.

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:55.370
Rena, snap out of it! Big sis!

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:00.460
Stick with me, okay, big sis?

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:08.130
No! Yui said she wants to be with me!

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:10.550
You're Alecto, aren't you?

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:14.930
Then give me power! The power
to protect Yui and everyone else!

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:16.550
Give it to me! Please!

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:40.870
Is this...?

00:16:47.590 --> 00:16:52.090
It's just as you said. I'm not
strong enough to do it alone.

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:58.260
I want you to lend me...
lend us... your strength.

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:02.140
Rena!

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:06.600
But if you do, you won't
be able to come back.

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:11.310
You will be taken by the
Regalia's curse. Just like us.

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:16.200
Is that okay?

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:20.330
I told you... We're sticking
together, forever.

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:30.630
Yui...

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:32.840
Let's go, sis.

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:34.170
Okay!

00:18:00.070 --> 00:18:01.280
Yui!

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:32.940
So this is the true power
of the Regalia, Erinius.

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:35.400
But it can't end yet!

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:08.270
Thank you for letting me truly see
the strength of Your Highness' will.

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:24.490
Ingrid... my role is at an end.

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:35.130
Rena!

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:40.970
In the name of Erinius,
Alecto will pierce through!

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:43.680
A deep black rock
forged in darkness...

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:48.560
From within the abyss...

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:53.600
Return to the void!

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:05.870
This is it...

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:10.580
This is Abel Lundestad's
final strike!

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:25.140
Graphite Charge!

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:34.230
Yui... Take care of Ingrid for me.

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:53.660
Well, that was fun!

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:57.420
I knew Abel would put up a good fight.
Died in the end, though.

00:21:05.680 --> 00:21:06.890
Abel...

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:29.580
What are we doing here?

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:41.750
--Yui!

00:21:58.400 --> 00:21:59.600
Everyone...
